s for <!-- -->Netflix<!-- -->.</p><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold\">The extra ≈ kr 1,679 a year goes straight into the CEO&#x27;s fun fund.</p><dl class=\"num flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 text-[13px] font-semibold\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-mint-ink\"><img src=\"/flags/all-f19721e4d1.svg#pk\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"flag\"/><dt>Pakistan<!-- -->, cheapest verified:</dt><dd>≈ kr 29.10 a month (Rs 800)</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-grape-dark\"><img src=\"/flags/all-f19721e4d1.svg#se\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"flag\"/><dt>Sweden<!-- -->:</dt><dd>kr 169.00 a month</dd></div></dl></section><section data-signature=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_4hbsnpfiulb_\" class=\"grid gap-5 rounded-[26px] bg-lavender p-5 text-ink shadow-card sm:p-7\"><header class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-grid shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[28%] bg-surface ring-1 ring-line\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20.88\" height=\"20.88\" fill=\"#E50914\"><path d=\"m5.398 0 8.348 23.602c2.346.059 4.856.398 4.856.398L10.113 0H5.398zm8.489 0v9.172l4.715 13.33V0h-4.715zM5.398 1.5V24c1.873-.225 2.81-.312 4.715-.398V14.83L5.398 1.5z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"grid min-w-0\"><span class=\"truncate font-bold\">Netflix Standard</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted\"><img src=\"/flags/all-f19721e4d1.svg#se\" alt=\"\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"flag\"/> <!-- -->Sweden</span></span></header><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] md:items-center md:gap-8\"><h2 id=\"_R_4hbsnpfiulb_\" class=\"grid gap-1\"><span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold\">It takes Netflix&#x27;s two co-CEOs</span><span class=\"display flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 py-1\"><span class=\"num text-[4.25rem] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-[5.5rem]\">59</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold sm:text-3xl\">seconds</span></span><span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold\">to earn a whole year of Netflix in Sweden<!-- --> <span class=\"num whitespace-nowrap\">(<!-- -->kr 2,028 a year<!-- -->, ≈ $201.36<!-- -->)</span>.</span></h2><div class=\"grid gap-3\"><div class=\"grid gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-surface p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"grid\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wide text-muted uppercase\">Their pay while you read</span><span class=\"display num text-[1.75rem] font-extrabold leading-tight\" aria-hidden=\"true\">≈ kr 0.00</span></span><span class=\"grid text-right\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wide text-muted uppercase\">Per second</span><span class=\"num text-[15px] font-bold\">≈ kr 34.20</span></span></div><div class=\"h-2.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-mint transition-[width] duration-100 ease-linear\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"num flex justify-between text-[12px] font-semibold text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Fills with a year of the bill</span></span></div><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-grape-dark\">Straight into the CEO&#x27;s fun fund.</p></div></div><dl class=\"grid gap-2.5 border-t border-grape/15 pt-4 text-[12px] leading-snug text-muted\"><div class=\"grid gap-0.5 sm:grid-cols-[7.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-3\"><dt class=\"font-extrabold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase text-[11px] sm:pt-px\">Filed pay</dt><dd><span class=\"num font-bold text-ink\">$107,093,279</span> (<!-- -->Greg Peters $53,187,307 + Ted Sarandos $53,905,972<!-- -->)<!-- -->, fiscal <!-- -->2025<!-- -->,<!-- --> <!-- -->total pay as filed<!-- -->.<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-link underline\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1065280/000119312526159286/d20613ddef14a.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Proxy statement (DEF 14A)<!-- -->, filed <!-- -->16 Apr 2026</a></dd></div><div class=\"grid gap-0.5 sm:grid-cols-[7.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-3\"><dt class=\"font-extrabold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase text-[11px] sm:pt-px\">Official price</dt><dd><span class=\"num font-bold text-ink\">kr 169<!-- --> <!-- -->a month</span>, <!-- -->Netflix Standard<!-- --> in <!-- -->Sweden<!-- -->, from <!-- -->Netflix<!-- -->&#x27;s own page<!-- -->, checked 4 Nov 2026<!-- -->.</dd></div><div class=\"grid gap-0.5 sm:grid-cols-[7.5rem_1fr] sm:gap-3\"><dt class=\"font-extrabold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase text-[11px] sm:pt-px\">Derived</dt><dd>A second of pay (<!-- -->≈ kr 34.20<!-- -->) is the year&#x27;s pay ÷ <!-- -->31,536,000<!-- --> seconds (365 days); the time is <!-- -->the<!-- --> yearly price ÷ a second of pay.<!-- --> Amounts in SEK are converted at the day&#x27;s rate (16 Nov).</dd></div></dl><footer class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-muted\">youfundceo.com</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"display flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-4 text-sm font-bold text-on-ink hover:opacity-90\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 1.5v7M4 4.5l3-3 3 3M2.5 8v3.5h9V8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Share</button><div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 bottom-6 z-30 flex justify-center px-4\"></div></footer></section></div><section class=\"grid gap-4\" aria-labelledby=\"plans\"><div class=\"grid gap-1\"><h2 id=\"plans\" class=\"text-xl font-extrabold sm:text-2xl\">All plans in <!-- -->Sweden</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Every plan, with its price in US dollars and the difference from the US.</p></div><ol class=\"divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-surface ring-1 ring-line\"><li data-name=\"standard\"><a class=\"prow\" href=\"/services/netflix\"><span class=\"prow-main\"><span class=\"prow-head\"><span class=\"prow-title\">Standard</span><span class=\"you-tag\">You</span></span><span class=\"num prow-sub\">kr 169<!-- --> / mo</span></span><span class=\"prow-end\"><span class=\"num prow-value\">≈ $16.78</span><span class=\"prow-unit\">/ mo</span></span><span class=\"num delta delta-save\">−16%</span></a></li><li data-name=\"basic\"><a class=\"prow\" href=\"/services/netflix/plans/basic\"><span class=\"prow-main\"><span class=\"prow-head\"><span class=\"prow-title\">Basic</span><span class=\"you-tag\">You</span></span><span class=\"num prow-sub\">kr 129<!-- --> / mo</span></span><span class=\"prow-end\"><span class=\"num prow-value\">≈ $12.81</span><span class=\"prow-unit\">/ mo</span></span><span class=\"num delta delta-none\">—</span></a></li><li data-name=\"premium\"><a class=\"prow\" href=\"/services/netflix/plans/premium\"><span class=\"prow-main\"><span class=\"prow-head\"><span class=\"prow-title\">Premium</span><span class=\"you-tag\">You</span></span><span class=\"num prow-sub\">kr 219<!-- --> / mo</span></span><span class=\"prow-end\"><span class=\"num prow-value\">≈ $21.75</span><span class=\"prow-unit\">/ mo</span></span><span class=\"num delta delta-save\">−19%</span></a></li></ol><a class=\"justify-self-start font-semibold text-link underline\" href=\"/countries/sweden\">Every subscription we track in <!-- -->Sweden</a></section><section class=\"grid gap-4\" aria-labelledby=\"what-you-get\"><div class=\"grid gap-1\"><h2 id=\"what-you-get\" class=\"text-xl font-extrabold sm:text-2xl\">What you get in <!-- -->Sweden</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">From Netflix&#x27;s own page for Sweden. The same plan can include different things in different countries: what differs here is marked.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-2\"><ul class=\"grid rounded-3xl bg-surface p-2 ring-1 ring-line\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-3\"><div class