bg-surface-2\">up to 2 extra member slots</li></ul></div></li></ul><div class=\"grid gap-1 px-1 text-sm text-muted\"><p>From <a href=\"https://help.netflix.com/en/node/24926/se\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"underline decoration-line underline-offset-2 hover:text-grape-dark\">help.netflix.com</a>, checked <!-- -->4 Nov 2026<!-- -->.</p><details><summary class=\"w-fit cursor-pointer font-semibold text-link\">What the page says</summary><ul class=\"mt-2 grid gap-1.5\"><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Standard<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 2 supported devices at a time” “Watch in 1080p (Full HD)” “Download on 2 supported devices at a time” “Option to add 1 extra member who doesn&#x27;t live with you”</li><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Basic<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 1 supported device at a time” “Watch in 720p (HD)” “Download on 1 supported device at a time”</li><li><strong class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Premium<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 4 supported devices at a time” “Watch in 4K (Ultra HD) + HDR” “Download on 6 supported devices at a time” “Option to add up to 2 extra members who don&#x27;t live with you”</li></ul></details></div></div></section><section class=\"grid gap-4\" aria-labelledby=\"cheapest\"><div class=\"grid gap-1\"><h2 id=\"cheapest\" class=\"text-xl font-extrabold sm:text-2xl\">Cheapest countries</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Same plan: Standard.</p></div><ol class=\"divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-surface ring-1 ring-line\"><li data-country=\"PK\" data-name=\"pakistan\"><a class=\"prow\" href=\"/services/netflix/pakistan\"><img src=\"/flags/all-f19721e4d1.svg#pk\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"flag\"/><span class=\"prow-main\"><span class=\"prow-head\"><span class=\"prow-title\"