\"/services/netflix/israel\"><img src=\"/flags/all-f19721e4d1.svg#il\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"flag\"/>Israel<span class=\"num chip-price\">≈ $17.10</span></a></div></section><section class=\"grid gap-4\" aria-labelledby=\"history\"><div class=\"grid gap-1\"><h2 id=\"history\" class=\"text-xl font-extrabold sm:text-2xl\">Price history in Sweden</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">We check Netflix every month and record every change.</p></div><ol class=\"grid gap-0 rounded-3xl bg-surface p-2 ring-1 ring-line\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2.5\"><span class=\"num w-24 shrink-0 text-sm text-muted\">29 Oct 2026</span><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-semibold\">Basic</span><span class=\"num shrink-0 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">first seen at </span><span class=\"font-bold\">kr 129</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2.5\"><span class=\"num w-24 shrink-0 text-sm text-muted\">29 Oct 2026</span><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-semibold\">Standard</span><span class=\"num shrink-0 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">first seen at </span><span class=\"font-bold\">kr 169</span></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl px-3 py-2.5\"><span class=\"num w-24 shrink-0 text-sm text-muted\">29 Oct 2026</span><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-semibold\">Premium</span><span class=\"num shrink-0 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-muted\">first seen at </span><span class=\"font-bold\">kr 219</span></span></li></ol></section><section class=\"grid max-w-3xl gap-4\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"grid gap-1\"><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-extrabold sm:text-2xl\">Questions</h2></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-surface ring-1 ring-line\"><details class=\"group px-5 py-4\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">How much is Netflix Standard in Sweden?<span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted\">Standard costs kr 169 (≈ $16.78) a month in Sweden. Other plans: Basic kr 129 a month; Premium kr 219 a month.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 py-4\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">Is Netflix cheaper in Sweden than in the US?<span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. Standard costs kr 169 a month in Sweden, about $16.78 a month. That&#x27;s 16% less than the US price of $19.99.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 py-4\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">Do you get less in a cheaper country?<span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted\">Usually not. The same plan has the same features and quality wherever it&#x27;s sold. What can differ is the catalogue, because of regional licensing, and which plans are offered.</p></details><details class=\"group px-5 py-4\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\">Why might I see a different price than the one here?<span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted\">Taxes, an introductory offer, paying in the iPhone app instead of on the website, or a recent price change. Prices in US dollars also move a little with the exchange rate, updated every week.</p></details></div></section><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Dataset\",\"name\":\"Netflix prices in Sweden\",\"description\":\"Netflix Standard costs kr 169 (≈ $16.78) a month in Sweden. The 3 Netflix plans we track there, in local currency and US dollars, with how Sweden ranks against other countries and its price history. Prices are read from official pages and help articles, with each price's last-checked date; US dollar amounts are conversions for comparison.\",\"url\":\"https://www.youfundceo.com/services/netflix/sweden\",\"keywords\":[\"Netflix price Sweden\",\"Netflix Sweden\",\"Netflix Standard price\"],\"creator\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://www.youfundceo.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"YouFundCEO\",\"url\":\"https://www.youfundceo.com/\"},\"license\":{\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"YouFundCEO terms of use\",\"url\":\"https://www.youfundceo.com/terms\"},\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"temporalCoverage\":\"2026-10-29/2026-11-04\",\"spatialCoverage\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Sweden\",\"identifier\":\"SE\"},\"variableMeasured\":[{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Price\",\"description\":\"Standard plan price in the local currency, per month or per year as the service bills it.\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Monthly price in US dollars\",\"description\":\"The local price converted at the day's exchange rate; annual prices divided by 12.\",\"unitText\":\"USD\"}],\"measurementTechnique\":\"Official pages and help articles\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-04\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much is Netflix Standard in Sweden?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Standard costs kr 169 (≈ $16.78) a month in Sweden. Other plans: Basic kr 129 a month; Premium kr 219 a month.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Netflix cheaper in Sweden than in the US?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Standard costs kr 169 a month in Sweden, about $16.78 a month. That's 16% less than the US price of $19.99.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you get less in a cheaper country?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Usually not. The same plan has the same features and quality wherever it's sold. What can differ is the catalogue, because of regional licensing, and which plans are offered.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why might I see a different price than the one here?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Taxes, an introductory offer, paying in the iPhone app instead of on the website, or a recent price change. Prices in US dollars also move a little with the exchange rate, updated every week.\"}}]}</script></div></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if(\"/$\"===d||\"/&\"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else\"$\"!==d&&\"$?\"!==d&&\"$~\"!==d&&\"$!\"!==d&&\"&\"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data=\"$\";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};\n$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data=\"$~\",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&(\"number\"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC(\"B:0\",\"S:0\")</script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\