 costs kr 169 (≈ $16.78) a month in Sweden. The 3 Netflix plans we track there, in local currency and US dollars, with how Sweden ranks against other countries and its price history. Prices are read from official pages and help articles, with each price's last-checked date; US dollar amounts are conversions for comparison.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.youfundceo.com/services/netflix/sweden\\\",\\\"keywords\\\":[\\\"Netflix price Sweden\\\",\\\"Netflix Sweden\\\",\\\"Netflix Standard price\\\"],\\\"creator\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://www.youfundceo.com/#organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"YouFundCEO\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.youfundceo.com/\\\"},\\\"license\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"CreativeWork\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"YouFundCEO terms of use\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.youfundceo.com/terms\\\"},\\\"isAccessibleForFree\\\":true,\\\"temporalCoverage\\\":\\\"2026-10-29/2026-11-04\\\",\\\"spatialCoverage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Place\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sweden\\\",\\\"identifier\\\":\\\"SE\\\"},\\\"variableMeasured\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PropertyValue\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Price\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Standard plan price in the local currency, per month or per year as the service bills it.\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"PropertyValue\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Monthly price in US dollars\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The local price converted at the day's exchange rate; annual prices divided by 12.\\\",\\\"unitText\\\":\\\"USD\\\"}],\\\"measurementTechnique\\\":\\\"Official pages and help articles\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-11-04\\\"}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"45:T473,{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How much is Netflix Standard in Sweden?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Standard costs kr 169 (≈ $16.78) a month in Sweden. Other plans: Basic kr 129 a month; Premium kr 219 a month.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is Netflix cheaper in Sweden than in the US?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Standard costs kr 169 a month in Sweden, about $16.78 a month. That's 16% less than the US price of $19.99.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you get less in a cheaper country?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Usually not. The same plan has the same features and quality wherever it's sold. What can differ is the catalogue, because of regional licensing, and which plans are offered.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Why might I see a different price than the one here?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Taxes, an introductory offer, paying in the iPhone app instead of on the website, or a recent price change. Prices in US dollars also move a little with the exchange rate, updated every week.\\\"}}]}3a:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$44\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$45\\\"}}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"40:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"ul\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 grid gap-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"standard\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Standard\\\",\\\":\\\"]}],\\\" \\\",\\\"“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 2 supported devices at a time” “Watch in 1080p (Full HD)” “Download on 2 supported devices at a time” “Option to add 1 extra member who doesn't live with you”\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"basic\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Basic\\\",\\\":\\\"]}],\\\" \\\",\\\"“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 1 supported device at a time” “Watch in 720p (HD)” “Download on 1 supported device at a time”\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"premium\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"strong\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Premium\\\",\\\":\\\"]}],\\\" \\\",\\\"“Unlimited ad-free movies, TV shows, and games” “Watch on 4 supported devices at a time” “Watch in 4K (Ultra HD) + HDR” “Download on 6 supported devices at a time” “Option to add up to 2 extra members who don't live with you”\\\"]}]]}]\\n41:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"prow-unit\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"/ mo\\\"}]\\n42:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"num delta delta-save\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"−73%\\\"}]\\n43:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L6\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/services/netflix\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"justify-self-start font-semibold text-link underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"See all \\\",245,\\\" countries\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:C\\n1b:C\\n1e:C\\n19:C\\nf:C\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"21:false\\n20:13953\\n\"])</script></body></html>"
